<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Home on ONDO Site</title><link>https://ondo-official.com/en/</link><description>Recent content in Home on ONDO Site</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>en</language><lastBuildDate>Fri, 25 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0900</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://ondo-official.com/en/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>Single 'Seijo' release</title><link>https://ondo-official.com/en/info/2026-09-25-seijo/</link><pubDate>Thu, 24 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0900</pubDate><guid>https://ondo-official.com/en/info/2026-09-25-seijo/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;“Seijo” was released on September 25, 2026. The music video also premieres on YouTube at 8 p.m. that day.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://nex-tone.link/A00227459"&gt;https://nex-tone.link/A00227459&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://youtu.be/QoY4D3qp2-U"&gt;https://youtu.be/QoY4D3qp2-U&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id="about-the-music"&gt;About the music&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;I titled it “Seijo” (“normal”) and tried to make music with something abnormal in it.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;When I started making the track, I vaguely wanted it to feel like a glitch. But when you use glitches and noise deliberately, they can feel planned and calculated. That makes the glitch seem unnatural. A glitch is more interesting when it is, in a sense, unreasonable.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>正常</title><link>https://ondo-official.com/en/discography/seijo/</link><pubDate>Thu, 24 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0900</pubDate><guid>https://ondo-official.com/en/discography/seijo/</guid><description/></item><item><title>溢れた</title><link>https://ondo-official.com/en/discography/afureta/</link><pubDate>Fri, 07 Aug 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://ondo-official.com/en/discography/afureta/</guid><description/></item><item><title>パシフィックゲイズ</title><link>https://ondo-official.com/en/discography/pacific-gaze/</link><pubDate>Fri, 10 Jul 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://ondo-official.com/en/discography/pacific-gaze/</guid><description/></item><item><title>敬愛</title><link>https://ondo-official.com/en/discography/keiai/</link><pubDate>Fri, 20 Mar 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://ondo-official.com/en/discography/keiai/</guid><description/></item><item><title>どこへ</title><link>https://ondo-official.com/en/discography/dokohe/</link><pubDate>Wed, 11 Feb 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://ondo-official.com/en/discography/dokohe/</guid><description/></item><item><title>ﾜゞ</title><link>https://ondo-official.com/en/discography/wawa/</link><pubDate>Wed, 14 Jan 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://ondo-official.com/en/discography/wawa/</guid><description/></item><item><title>Q地点</title><link>https://ondo-official.com/en/discography/q-chiten/</link><pubDate>Fri, 26 Sep 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://ondo-official.com/en/discography/q-chiten/</guid><description/></item><item><title>Muga</title><link>https://ondo-official.com/en/discography/muga/</link><pubDate>Wed, 02 Jul 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://ondo-officia