m><item><title>圏外ステイタス</title><link>https://ondo-official.com/en/discography/kengai-status/</link><pubDate>Fri, 11 Aug 2023 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://ondo-official.com/en/discography/kengai-status/</guid><description/></item><item><title>About</title><link>https://ondo-official.com/en/about/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://ondo-official.com/en/about/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;[Profile] ondo is a Kobe-based Vocaloid producer / musician. He creates songs using Vocaloid and other synthesized voices, and releases his work through YouTube, Niconico, and streaming platforms.&lt;/p&gt;
